{"metadata":{"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"slug":[{"Plain":"Leray谱序列"},0],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"title":[{"Plain":"Leray 谱序列"},2]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>观念</h2>\n<p>设\n$$\r\nf = (f^*\\dashv f_*)\\colon \\mathcal Y \\to \\mathcal X\r\n$$\n为 "},{"Local":{"url":"∞-意象","text":"$\\infty$-意象"}},{"Plain":"之间的"},{"Local":{"url":"几何态射","text":"几何态射"}},{"Plain":", 记 $\\Gamma_{\\mathcal X}$ 为 $\\mathcal X \\to\\mathsf{Ani}$ 的直像部分, 即"},{"Local":{"url":"整体截面","text":"整体截面"}},{"Plain":". 那么\n$$\r\n    \\Gamma_{\\mathcal Y} = \\Gamma_{\\mathcal X}\\circ f_*.\r\n$$</p>\n<p>设 $F\\in\\mathsf{Sp}(\\mathcal Y)$ 为 $\\mathcal Y$ 的"},{"Local":{"url":"稳定化","text":"稳定化"}},{"Plain":"的对象. 考虑 $\\mathsf{Sp}(\\mathcal X)$ 的标准 "},{"Local":{"url":"t-结构","text":"t-结构"}},{"Plain":"给出的 $f_* F$ 的 "},{"Local":{"url":"Postnikov塔","text":"Postnikov 滤"}},{"Plain":", 再以 $\\Gamma_{\\mathcal X}$ 作用得到一个"},{"Local":{"url":"滤过","text":"滤过"}},{"Local":{"url":"谱","text":"谱"}},{"Plain":"\n$$\r\n\\cdots\\to\r\n\\Gamma_{\\mathcal X}(\\tau_{\\leq q-1}f_*F)\r\n\\to\r\n\\Gamma_{\\mathcal X}(\\tau_{\\leq q}f_*F)\r\n\\to\\cdots.\r\n$$\n这个滤过谱对应的"},{"Local":{"url":"滤对象的谱序列","text":"谱序列"}},{"Plain":"称为 <strong>Leray 谱序列</strong>.</p>\n"}]}}